{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"thread\": \"一个人因为长期受委屈而离开熟悉的生活，却始终怀念曾经被接纳、被陪伴的日子。他在想回去和不愿再受伤之间反复挣扎，最后终于承认过去的伤害与快乐都是真的，决定带着想念继续向前，不再为了留住亲近而委屈自己。\",\n  \"sections\": [\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S01\",\n      \"caught\": \"离开后失落迷惘\",\n      \"echo\": \"\",\n      \"why\": \"能\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S02\",\n      \"caught\": \"舍不得也记着委屈\",\n      \"echo\": \"S01\",\n      \"why\": \"能\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S03\",\n      \"caught\": \"想起亲近又心酸\",\n      \"echo\": \"S02\",\n      \"why\": \"能\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S04\",\n      \"caught\": \"盼旧日重来又怀疑\",\n      \"echo\": \"S03\",\n      \"why\": \"能\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S05\",\n      \"caught\": \"不愿否认美好却累了\",\n      \"echo\": \"S02\",\n      \"why\": \"能\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S06\",\n      \"caught\": \"重新想念被陪伴\",\n      \"echo\": \"S04\",\n      \"why\": \"能\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S07\",\n      \"caught\": \"孤单让他怀疑离开\",\n      \"echo\": \"S06\",\n      \"why\": \"能\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S08\",\n      \"caught\": \"暖意短暂留不住\",\n      \"echo\": \"S06\",\n      \"why\": \"能\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S09\",\n      \"caught\": \"想回去的原因不明\",\n      \"echo\": \"S08\",\n      \"why\": \"能\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S10\",\n      \"caught\": \"想念归属却不敢回头\",\n      \"echo\": \"S09\",\n      \"why\": \"能\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S11\",\n      \"caught\": \"先稳住眼下再谈回头\",\n      \"echo\": \"S10\",\n      \"why\": \"能\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S12\",\n      \"caught\": \"承认受伤也承认快乐\",\n      \"echo\": \"S05\",\n      \"why\": \"能\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S13\",\n      \"caught\": \"想亲近也能独自生活\",\n      \"echo\": \"S12\",\n      \"why\": \"能\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"overall\": \"最吃力的是S08，停留时间很短，却要迅速抓住刚刚得到的温暖为什么又留不住；S13也比较密集，情绪变化好几次。最抓人的是S06到S07，从怀念有人陪伴的温柔突然转向对未来孤单的恐惧，反差很强；最后S12到S13又把这种挣扎慢慢化成了向前生活的决心。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "6003767e-3159-4ced-876a-97587b3811da", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261105T194223937356Z", "elapsed_seconds": 41.407, "completed_utc": "2026-11-05T19:43:05.339909+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "605ad439a0377e18defb5a9e4cd2ceeaa1691d066d156650a6a3ccd757b7d711", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261105T194223937356Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "ae63ccf5a4c9122f8eabfa21f1cf386586970a2ddd2ccd269a3e2cd90f41afdf"}}}
